### Test Payment Confirmation
POST http://localhost:5103/api/payment/confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookingId": "YOUR_BOOKING_ID_HERE",
  "paymentId": "pay_XXXXXXXXXXXX",
  "orderId": "order_XXXXXXXXXXXX",
  "signature": "RAZORPAY_SIGNATURE_HERE"
}

### Notes:
# 1. Replace YOUR_BOOKING_ID_HERE with an actual booking GUID
# 2. The paymentId, orderId, and signature should come from Razorpay's response
# 3. In your frontend, after Razorpay payment success, you'll receive:
#    - razorpay_payment_id (use as paymentId)
#    - razorpay_order_id (use as orderId)
#    - razorpay_signature (use as signature)
